# Windows batch files MUST keep CRLF line endings.  An LF-mangled .bat
# fails in cmd.exe in ways that look like logic bugs (labels/gotos not
# found, `set /p` reading a stray CR into a variable), so the Windows
# recovery driver would dead-end before the journey even started.
# [INFRA-01]
*.bat text eol=crlf

# The meta disc's restore scripts and README are written to the disc byte
# for byte and pinned by SHA-256 (tests/unit/test_meta_assets_golden.py,
# #689): never let a checkout rewrite their line endings.
src/lcsas/meta/assets/* -text
